The challenge is ensuring the policy comprehensively covers both the first-party costs the company incurs and third-party liabilities.

1093
01:35:26,900 --> 01:35:33,390
It demonstrates a proactive approach to protecting the company's financial health in the face of dynamic digital risks that can materialize rapidly.

1094
