But they also consider implementing a continuous risk monitoring system to stay more agile.

1096
01:35:45,680 --> 01:35:49,450
This moves beyond periodic checks to real-time vigilance, doesn't it?

1097
01:35:49,950 --> 01:35:53,850
What are the advantages of continuous monitoring in a rapidly changing risk environment?

1098
01:35:54,230 --> 01:35:58,720
It absolutely does, and it represents a significant leap forward in agility and responsiveness.

1099
01:35:59,420 --> 01:36:10,150
While annual and quarterly reviews provide important periodic checkpoints, a continuous risk monitoring system allows for real-time tracking of key risk indicators across the enterprise.

