1416
02:10:51,260 --> 02:10:56,210
This is a classic example of sophisticated international tax and corporate structuring.

1417
02:10:56,230 --> 02:11:07,660
Establishing a regional holding company in a jurisdiction known for its favorable tax treaties and robust legal framework like Singapore offers several primary benefits beyond just a lower headline tax rate.

1418
