1420
02:11:25,940 --> 02:11:34,620
It also offers a stable legal and regulatory environment for intellectual property holding and can enhance the overall perceived credibility and governance of the regional operations.

1421
02:11:35,520 --> 02:11:41,300
It's about creating an efficient, compliant and strategically located financial command center for international expansion.

1422
02:11:41,360 --> 02:11:50,110
